loading_tips = PackedStringArray("Deckhands crouch and draw back their cutlass before they lunge: step out of the line.", "Powder Monkeys light a fuse and lob a keg: a ring marks where it lands and blows. A headshot makes them drop it.", "The galleon's deck is high ground: two gangplanks lead up, and the bulwarks hold you in.", "The stilt huts and rope bridges make a loop round the lagoon, away from the crowd on the quay.", "In the Broadside wave the Barnacle Queen fires on the quay: every cannonball lands in a glowing ring.", "Captain Barnacle calls his cannons down round you and slams his anchor: jump the ring, run from the markers.")
